@baseUrl = http://localhost:7072
@username = realUsername
@password = realPass
@token = token

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Change password (also allowed with a first-login token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "ReplaceWithNewPassword2"
}

### Log in again after changing the password, then replace token above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Student service or teacher
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?skip=0&take=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid query value should return 400 for an authorized user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?skip=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
